{
  "_readme": [
    "REFERENCE THEME. dark.json defines the complete token surface; every other",
    "theme is applied as a deep merge OVER this file, so a partial theme is legal",
    "and a key it omits can never inherit a stale value from whatever was applied",
    "before it. Keys added here must be added here FIRST - the loader validates",
    "other themes against this one.",
    "",
    "css/theme.css is generated from this file by .github/scripts/sync-theme.js.",
    "It is the pre-fetch fallback and must never be hand-edited in its :root block.",
    "",
    "colors.<group>.<key> -> --color-<prefix>-<kebab-key>. Group prefixes are fixed",
    "in the loader's mapping table; do not rename a group without updating both the",
    "loader and sync-theme.js.",
    "",
    "tokens.<name> -> --<name>, emitted verbatim with NO prefix. Structure and",
    "sizing live in css/base.css; this block exists so an accessibility or custom",
    "theme can override a specific structural token (shadows, radii, focus ring)",
    "without a second mechanism. The reference theme leaves it empty on purpose -",
    "populating it here would duplicate base.css and drift.",
    "",
    "Colours are opaque by policy: the palette is composited, and overlapping",
    "transparency is unmanageable. The loader trims 8-digit hex to 6 and warns.",
    "semantic.scrim/scrimStrong are the sanctioned exception - a modal backdrop",
    "must be see-through - which is why rgb()/hsl() functional forms are accepted."
  ],

  "id": "dark",
  "label": "Dark",
  "base": "dark",
  "description": "Default dark theme. Reference schema for all other themes.",
  "author": "Eltryus - Ricardo Marques",
  "license": "AGPL-3.0-or-later",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/RicardoJCMarques/EasyCAM5000",

